# expect: 127
# expect: 69
# expect: 76
# expect: 70
# End-to-end buf+pointer round-trip: write a buf, take its address,
# walk through it with ptr-offset, deref each element. Demonstrates
# the full toolkit a C extern would use to read the buf contents.
def [Buf 4 u8] elf [[Buf 4 u8] 0x7f 0x45 0x4c 0x46]
def [Ptr u8] p [addr $elf->0]
print [ptr-deref $p]
print [ptr-deref [ptr-offset $p 1]]
print [ptr-deref [ptr-offset $p 2]]
print [ptr-deref [ptr-offset $p 3]]
